id: pm-rust-bench-workflow
title: Generalize native benchmark workflow beyond the performance branch
description: "Orchestrator review identified branch-specific workflow gating, a fixed historical BENCH_BASE_SHA and snippet-sensitive negative controls. The current PR keeps this historical benchmark protocol; generalize future source-PR and dispatch behavior separately without confusing ordinary benchmarks with implementation-specific revert controls."
